+# The sdist is built from the git-tracked file list that setuptools-scm
+# supplies, which would otherwise carry development state that no installer
+# needs. Everything below is tooling memory, not part of the package.
+exclude PLAN.md
+exclude BACKLOG.md
+exclude JOURNAL.md
+exclude JOURNAL-archive.md
+prune .jeffy
